Link the mill with /app/hull.sh after source edits. The agent binary is /app/bin/twinefuse.
A throwaway mill is go build -o /tmp/twinefuse.ref berth.local/twinefuse/berthcli from /app.
Agent /app/bin/twinefuse must sew the same rows.ndjson and hitch.idx as /tmp/twinefuse.ref.
Do not copy that throwaway over the agent mill.
